
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3002
@noteId = 0caf44a6-8235-44f6-aec3-f25d76c953b1
@accessToken = replace-with-your-token




### Petición 1: Obtener usuarios (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets HTTP/1.1


### Petición 2: Crear un nuevo usuario (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "1767687687",
  "description": "juan@example.com"
}

### Petición 3: Actualizar un ticket (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{noteId}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nuevo título",
  "description": "Nuhshshshhshhs",
  "priority": "OPEN"
}

### Petición 4: Eliminar un ticket (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tickets/{{noteId}} HTTP/1.1
